  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mentorship Award: Moving Narratives 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">12 individuals received a Mentorship Award Moving Narratives. This mentorship programme was implemented in collaboration with the British Council. Through the programme, Prince Claus Mentorship Awards were granted to socially and politically engaged artists or cultural practitioners whose work questions dominant narratives and their role in our lives. The Mentorship Award: Moving Narratives is a multidisciplinary programme that re-examines legacies of the past, defies euro-centric social and historical discourses, centres the perspectives of marginalised communities, and forges connections between contemporary emancipatory movements and their historical roots.</narrative>
  </description>
